<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>澳大利亚通过天然气储备法令液化天然气出口商感到不安</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters</link><description>澳大利亚通过了一项法律，要求液化天然气出口商将多达五分之一的供应量保留给国内市场。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters'&gt;澳大利亚通过天然气储备法令液化天然气出口商感到不安&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Australia Passes Gas Reserve Law in Upset to LNG Exporters&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/australia-set-to-pass-gas-reserve-law-in-upset-to-lng-exporters</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 13:31:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stocks Rise With Nasdaq Futures, Treasuries Fall: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>据报道韩国正在考虑扩大股票稳定基金</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund</link><description>据《每日经济新闻》报道，随着当局准备在波动加剧的情况下进行干预，韩国正在考虑扩大其 10.76 万亿韩元（80 亿美元）的股市稳定基金。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund'&gt;据报道韩国正在考虑扩大股票稳定基金&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Korea Plans Market Meeting as Stock Swings Put Fund in Focus&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/south-korea-reportedly-mulls-expanding-stock-stabilization-fund</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:22:32 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</link><description>随着感恩节假期后市场重新开放，美国国债交投清淡，亚洲股市上涨抑制了对避险资产的需求。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens'&gt;股市上涨削弱避险需求，国债回落&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Treasuries Retreat as Gains in Equities Sap Demand for Havens&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/treasuries-retreat-as-gains-in-equities-sap-demand-for-havens</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 02:43:08 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本“东京漂移”汽车文化吸引全球车迷</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/japan-s-tokyo-drift-car-culture-draws-global-fans-video</link><description>日本最新的愿望清单景点：《速度与激情》系列电影的世界。日本的汽车界吸引了来自世界各地的车迷，游客纷纷涌入，一睹因电影而永垂不朽的稀有丰田和日产车型。斯特凡·尼古拉还有更多。 （来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/japan-s-tokyo-drift-car-culture-draws-global-fans-video'&gt;日本“东京漂移”汽车文化吸引全球车迷&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan’s ‘Tokyo Drift’ Car Culture Draws Global Fans&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/japan-s-tokyo-drift-car-culture-draws-global-fans-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:18:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>